ectly to lower loneliness (UCLS) scores, rather than any direct psychological impact of support itself.', 'perplexity': 1.4090002117588092, 'mean_token_prob': 0.8155938334994569, 'corruption_type': 'motivation', 'min_prob': 0.01538897804949971, 'token_prob_slope': -0.005002949804000342, 'prob_variance': 0.07812071622081258, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 1.0665909514197354, 'avg_nll': 0.34288038320667324}

